OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud, with showery
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle clearing
OL,7,Fto brighter skies during the morning,
OL,8,Fwith plenty of hazy spells of sunshine
OL,9,Fdeveloping for the afternoon. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm and rather muggy, with light
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine evening to come. Cloud
OL,14,Fincreasing overnight from the north,
OL,15,Fwith the promise of some rain moving
OL,16,Fin during the early hours, which may
OL,17,Fbe heavy in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
