OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy and wet start to the
OL,6,Fday as rain slowly clears southwards
OL,7,Fduring the morning. Drier and brighter
OL,8,Ffor the afternoon, with hazy spells of
OL,9,Fsunshine for many.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells and showers expected throughout
OL,13,Fthis period. Some of the showers will
OL,14,Fbe heavy and times, with the risk of
OL,15,Fhail and thunder. A fresh feel for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
